Regulatory & Red Flag Targets: Search for SEC disclosure delinquency notices, late filing notifications (NT 10-K/10-Q), auditor resignations, adverse internal control audits (SOX 404), and enforcement actions for material misstatements or omission of material risks. Investigate gag orders, aggressive non-disclosure agreement (NDA) enforcement, SLAPP suits or legal threats targeting investigative journalists and researchers, and SEC/OSHA whistleblower retaliation complaints. Check investigative databases (e.g., ICIJ offshore leaks, OpenCorporates) for undisclosed shell companies, complex tax haven ownership structures, opaque related-party transactions, or an evident pattern of stonewalling media and public records inquiries.